# TIA Portal Project

This folder contains the **Siemens TIA Portal V20 project** for the Gantry Robot system.

The project contains the PLC control program for the **Siemens S7-300** controller and is used together with **S7-PLCSIM** and **Factory I/O**.

**Main program:** OB1
**Programming language:** LAD (Ladder Logic)
**TIA Portal version:** V20
